		- Hamilton requires 2 point calibration cp1 and cp2. 
		- I want the interface to show the current status of both calibration points.
		- I want the interface to show the current value of both calibration points. The values are stored in registers 5 and 6 of the CP#Status holding registers.
		- I want the interface to show the quality of the sensor.
		- I want the interface to allow the operator to set a new calibration for cp1 and cp2 independently.
